<fw type="sig" place="bottom">N 4</fw><fw type="catch" place="bottom">&#x201E;Fahre</fw><lb/>
<pb n="200" facs="#f0211"/>
<p>&#x201E;Fahre in den Palla&#x017F;t, und erwu&#x0364;rge mir<lb/>
